[[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Working on the right side, use a screwdriver to remove the light\ncluster.</p><p>2. Disconnect the electrical connection.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Left number plate light</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890318\">F50</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Right number plate light</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2890321\">F51</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035430.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<p>1. If necessary, rotate the bulb holder (1a) in an anti-clockwise\ndirection, extract it and remove the bulb (1b).</p><p>Press fit</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2035431.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the light cluster\nand the bulb are not damaged.</p><p>If removed, refit the bulb and the bulb\nholder.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection.</p><p>Check the operation of the number plate\nlights.</p><p>Fit the light cluster.</p>"]]